several real races in the target event is barely moved by it. \code{ability}
is then rebuilt from the blended \code{ability_raw} using the athlete's
EXISTING \code{shrinkage} -- this adds evidence about where the athlete's true
ability sits, it does not re-argue how confident the estimator should be,
so \code{shrinkage}/\code{kappa}/\code{w_total} are left alone.
